  "description": "<p class=\"\" data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"586\">De <strong data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"302\">Axis M4327-P</strong> is een hoogwaardige <strong data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"357\">360 graden panoramische camera</strong> voor professioneel gebruik. Ideaal voor winkels, kantoren of openbare ruimtes waar volledig overzicht gewenst is. Dankzij de compacte vormgeving en haarscherpe beeldkwaliteit biedt deze camera discrete én effectieve beveiliging.</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"687\">Deze unit is <strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"628\">nieuw in originele doos</strong>, volledig ongebruikt en <strong data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"686\">direct klaar voor installatie</strong>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"817\">✅ 360° overzicht in één beeld<br data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"721\">✅ 6MP sensor met helder en gedetailleerd beeld<br data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"770\">✅ Nieuw in doos<br data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"788\">✅ 1 maand garantie inbegrepen</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"868\"><strong data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"868\">Professionele beveiliging – direct leverbaar!</strong></p>\r\n<hr class=\"\" data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"873\">\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"918\">📋 <strong data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"918\">Specificaties Axis M4327-P – Wit</strong></h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"973\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"973\">📷 <strong data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"934\">Type:</strong> Panoramische netwerkcamera (fisheye)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1010\">🌐 <strong data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"993\">Beeldhoek:</strong> 360° overzicht</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1066\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1066\">📸 <strong data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1030\">Resolutie:</strong> 6MP sensor – tot 2560x2560 pixels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1129\">💡 <strong data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1094\">Lichtgevoeligheid:</strong> Hoge prestaties bij weinig licht</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1201\">⚙️ <strong data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1148\">Functies:</strong> Digitale PTZ, dewarp-functionaliteit, edge storage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1247\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1247\">🔌 <strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1219\">Voeding:</strong> Power over Ethernet (PoE)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1322\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1322\">📶 <strong data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1265\">Netwerk:</strong> IP camera – compatibel met Axis VMS en andere systemen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1383\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1383\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1344\">Meegeleverd:</strong> Originele doos + fabrieksaccessoires</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1405\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1405\">🎨 <strong data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1399\">Kleur:</strong> Wit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1450\">🧼 <strong data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1421\">Staat:</strong> Nieuw in doos – ongebruikt</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1487\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1470\">Garantie:</strong> 3 maanden garantie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
